<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">FPC-VLA: A Vision-Language-Action Framework with a Supervisor for Failure Prediction and Correction
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yifan Yang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>The Institute of Robotics and Automatic Information System, Tianjin Key Laboratory of Intelligent Robotics, and TBI center, Nankai University, Tianjin 300350, China. Emails: yangyifan@mail.nankai.edu.cn; liujt@nankai.edu.cn.
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Xiaomi EV, Beijing, China.
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
